  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2015/08/IMG_7915.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14.6666669845581px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 21.3333339691162px; orphans: auto; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 1; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; display: inline !important; float: none; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">(356 fotos) El barrio San Joaqu&iacute;n de Onda ha festejado este domingo a su patr&oacute;n, con misa y procesi&oacute;n por la tarde, </span></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2015/08/IMG_8365.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14.6666669845581px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 21.3333339691162px; orphans: auto; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 1; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; display: inline !important; float: none; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">y con el tradicional espect&aacute;culo de variedades nocturno con artistas del propios barrio y otras personas que han colaborado, entre ellas la reina de&nbsp;las fiestas del barrio, Irune Mata Pitarch, la reina de la Fira 2014, Ana Gargallo Porcar, y su dama Luc&iacute;a Aibar Sol.</span></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2015/08/IMG_8295.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-align: left; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); text-transform: none; line-height: 21.33px; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Arial; font-size: 14.66px; font-variant: normal; word-spacing: 0px; float: none; display: inline !important; white-space: normal; widows: 1; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14.6666669845581px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 21.3333339691162px; orphans: auto; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 1; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; display: inline !important; float: none; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">El acto ha sido presentado, como cada a&ntilde;o, por el locutor de Onda TV Ram&oacute;n Cabedo Esteve y ha tenido un papel destacado Chabelita Love.</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-align: left; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); text-transform: none; line-height: 21.33px; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Arial; font-size: 14.66px; font-variant: normal; word-spacing: 0px; float: none; display: inline !important; white-space: normal; widows: 1; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;\"><span style=\"text-align: left; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); text-transform: none; line-height: 21.33px; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Arial; font-size: 14.66px; font-variant: normal; word-spacing: 0px; float: none; display: inline !important; white-space: normal; widows: 1; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;\"></span></span></p>\n"
